== Day 0 --- Establish decision rights
<day-0-establish-decision-rights>
Board sponsor designates incident commander, threat assessment chair,
legal/privacy authority, fire/building AHJ liaison, disability-access
coordinator, EMS liaison and independent evaluator. All participants
sign a minimum-necessary information protocol. Secure records remain
separate from voluntary safe-storage participation.

